{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/t20260618_1403842.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:45.745684+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/t20260618_1403842.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h2>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营的通知</h2>\n<p>发布时间：2026-06-18</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><span>为增进全国优秀本科生对武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院办学实力、学科平台与培养体系的全面了解，启迪学生的科研创新思维，拓展学术眼界，搭建师生面对面交流、深度研学的优质平台，现面向全国</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营。</span></span></p><p><span>    <strong><span>一、简介</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院（以下简称“学院”）位于武汉理工大学马房山校区，是</span></span><strong><span><span><span>我国材料科学与工程学科人才培养、科学研究的重要基地之一</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。学院为国家建材建工、汽车与交通行业培养了</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>万多名卓越人才，提供了近</span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span>项重大科技成果，特别是为建材工业从无到有、走向世界并引领世界建材工业发展作出重大贡献，为国防、现代工业、新兴产业、国家和区域经济的发展提供了关键技术支撑。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>（一）材料学科简介</span></strong></p><p><span><span>材料科学与工程学科（以下简称“学科”）于</span></span><span><span><span>1988</span></span></span><span><span>年被列为</span></span><strong><span><span>首批国家重点学科，</span></span><span><span><span>1996</span></span></span><span><span>年被列为</span></span><span><span><span>首批国家“</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>211</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>工程”重点建设学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2007</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年被列为一级学科国家重点学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2017</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年入选首批国家“双一流”建设学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年入选第二轮国家“双一流”建设学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>ESI</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>国际影响力排名世界前</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0.187‰</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，位居全球第</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>31</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>位</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/cd5c22adff84eda8d4e6.png\" title=\"\"/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/82dd941246c73b46971d.png\" title=\"\"/></p><p><strong><span>（二）培养特色</span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院拥有材料科学与工程、纳米科学与工程一级学科博士点，材料与化工专业学位博士点，低空技术与工程（自主设置交叉学科）博士点，材料科学与工程博士后流动站。学院现有本科生</span></span><span><span><span>2546</span></span></span><span><span>人，研究生</span></span><span><span><span>3621</span></span></span><span><span>人（其中博士生</span></span><span><span><span>1048</span></span></span><span><span>人），是我国材料学科人才培养规模位居首位、行业特色鲜明的高层次人才培养基地。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院立足理工科专业办学特色与人才培养实际，通过党建引领高质量发展、健全协同育人制度体系、拓展线上线下全场景育人阵地、汇聚数字赋能和全员育人合力，深度推进价值引领、知识传授与能力培养有机融合，持续探索凝练新时代理工科院校全员、全过程、全方位、全领域育人新范式，全面提升人才培养质量与思政育人实效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院长期坚持教学改革与探索，承担国家级、省部级等教学研究项目</span></span><span><span><span>40</span></span></span><span><span>余项，建成国家级教学团队</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>支，湖北省教师</span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span>教学团队</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>支。</span></span><span><span><span>2009</span></span></span><span><span>年以来，获得国家级教学成果奖</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>项，省级教学成果奖</span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span>项；建成国家级精品课程</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>门、国家级精品资源共享课</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>门、国家级视频公开课</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>门、国家级一流课程</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span>门、省级一流课程</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>门。</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4ab51c5962f0b922f080.png\" title=\"\"/></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>教学科研团队</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>材料学科现有教职员工</span></span><span><span><span>500</span></span></span><span><span>余人，其中两院院士</span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>人，国家级领军人才</span></span><span><span><span>37</span></span></span><span><span>人，国家级青年人才</span></span><span><span><span>41</span></span></span><span><span>人。建设了一支</span></span><strong><span><span><span>以院士、国家重大科技计划首席科学家、全球高被引科学家等为学术带头人</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，整体科研能力强、结构合理、富于创新的学术队伍，拥有国家自然科学基金委创新群体、教育部创新团队、科技部重点领域创新团队、国防科技创新团队、湖北省创新群体等国家和省部级团队</span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span>余支。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/ff39168e2fed34caebf6.png\" title=\"\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>材料学院坚持党建引领，重视师德师风建设，坚守文化传承，形成了以“团结、传承、专注、创新”为核心的独特学</span></span><span><span><span>科文化，培育出</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个全国教育系统先进集体、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个全国高校黄大年式教师团队、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>支全国高校“双带头人”教师党支部书记“强国行”专项行动团队、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个全国党建工作样板支部，先后涌现全国最美教师</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、国家级教学名师奖</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、全国优秀教师</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、全国先进工作者</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、全国优秀科技工作者</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、全国创新争先奖</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、万人计划教学名师</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人、全国杰出工程师奖</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>科学研究</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>材料学科拥有材料复合新技术全国重点实验室、硅酸盐科学与先进建材全国重点实验室、先进玻璃材料全国重点实验室、高温轻合金及应用技术全国重点实验室、光纤传感技术与网络国家工程研究中心、材料研究与测试中心、材料科学与工程实验教学中心等</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个国家级平台</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，材料复合新技术国际联合实验室、环境友好建筑材料国际科技合作基地等</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个国际合作基地</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>以及特种功能材料技术教育部重点实验室、绿色建筑材料及制造教育部工程研究中心、燃料电池湖北省重点实验室等</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个省部级重点研究基地开展科学研究</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>材料学科围绕建筑材料绿色制造与战略性新兴建筑材料、特种用关键新材料、高效能源转换与储能新材料及器件、面向重大工程及装备的光纤传感智能材料、新能源与智能汽车关键材料和技术、材料与数理学科交叉前沿与新材料创制、重大疾病纳米新药创制及化学生物基础等领域形成新的学科优势，实现科学研究创新发展。近</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年，与学科共建单位一起承担国家重点任务</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>200</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>余项</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，到款经费</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>亿元；</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2000</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年以来，以第一完成人</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>单位获国家科技成果奖励</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>项</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>（近五年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>项），在</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>Nature</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>Science</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>发表论文</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>篇</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，获国际学术奖励</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>项</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，创办的</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>Interdisciplinary\nMaterials</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>期刊</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年影响因子达</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>31.6</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>材料学科始终秉持国际化发展战略，与英国牛津大学、美国密歇根大学、日本东北大学等</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>所国际著名高校</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>开展科技合作，共建“材料复合新技术国际联合实验室”“环境友好建筑材料国际联合实验室”两大国际科研平台；与新加坡国立大学、澳大利亚莫纳什大学、伯明翰大学等国际著名高校开展高层次人才培养合作。主办包括世界大学材料科学与工程领导论坛、《自然》系列国际会议、首届全球华人材料大会、第</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>届无机非金属材料专题研讨会、第十六届全国高校材料学院院长论坛在内的</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>余场国内外高水平学术会议</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/6be7c81e0ed800e51bd6.jpg\" title=\"\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>近年来，学院紧紧围绕“瞄准国际一流、突出行业特色、建设研究型学院”的目标，秉持</span></span><strong><span><span><span>“尚德启智、开物铸材”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>的院训，依托材料学科丰富的科研基地和人力资源优势，整合材料学科资源，营造全学科育人氛围，构建了本科生创新能力“金字塔”培养体系，开创了以</span></span><strong><span><span><span>“才思飞扬”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>材料文化节为核心的大学生科技创新文化品牌，促进了全院师生对材料文化的充分理解和高度认同，形成了人人争做卓越材料人的生动局面。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/d166bb5334b0acbfb231.png\" title=\"\"/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学生成长成才</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>在人才培养过程中，学院坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于教育的重要论述，积极将学科优势和行业特色转化为育人资源和育人优势，认真落实立德树人根本任务，坚持德智体美劳“五育融合”，全面推进“四全育人”落地见效，培养了</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>一批具有全国示范作用的基层党组织和全国影响力的优秀大学生</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院全方位支持学生开展科技创新创业活动，在学校创业园建设了</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>600</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>平方米的</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>“铸材”大学生创新创业基地</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，培养了一批具有全国影响力的优秀学生典型，其中大学生“新型纳米储能器件团队”获得首批“小平科技创新团队”称号，郭万里、林常规、赵云龙、熊方宇等</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>名大学生获得“中国青少年科技创新奖”，</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>赵云龙同学先后获得“中国大学生年度人物”和“中国大学生自强之星标兵”称号，受到习近平总书记接见</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，并作为教育部重点宣传典型人物在《人民日报》等重要媒体宣传报道，卢鹏荐获</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2021</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年度“中国大学生自强之星”称号，陈鹏飞在</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年获得“中国大学生自强之星”奖学金。在学生创业实践方面，先后涌现出了彭凡、卢鹏荐、胡涛、李自力等一批有显著影响力的创业先进典型。</span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/60369d274c88ff242f15.jpg\" title=\"\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2018</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年以来，学院学生在“挑战杯”全国大学生课外学术科技作品竞赛、中国“互联网</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>+”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>大学生创新创业大赛、全国大学生节能减排社会实践与科技竞赛等全国各类高水平创新创业竞赛中获</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>国家级奖励</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>184</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>项</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年，学院学生荣获中国国际大学生创新大赛（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）国家级金奖、第十一届中国大学生材料热处理创新创业大赛全国一等奖、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>湖北省大学生创业大赛冠军等各类</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>国家级、省部级创新创业类竞赛奖项</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>40</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>余项</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/a18618046bc69cdbb577.jpg\" title=\"\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span>作为建材<span><span>建工</span></span><span>、</span><span>汽车、交通等相关</span><span><span>行业特色鲜明的</span></span><span>材料类</span>高层次人才培养基地，学院充分挖掘行业办学优势，与行业企业联合建立</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>余个人才培养基地，培养了以</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>中国科学院院士南策文、张清杰、张跃，中国工程院院士姜德生、张联盟、聂祚仁、彭寿、傅正义、杨中民为代表的科技领军人才，以中国建材集团党委书记、董事长周育先，中国信息通信科技集团有限公司党委副书记、总经理何书平，中国第一汽车集团有限公司总经理刘亦功</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>为代表的行业领军人才。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院充分依托武汉理工大学建材建工行业理事会<span><span>、汽车行业理事会、交通行业理事会</span></span><span>，</span>组织学生到校友企业与相关行业开展实习实践活动，通过举办专场招聘会引导毕业生到建材建工行业<span>、</span><span><span>汽车、交通等</span></span><span><span>行业</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>战略新兴</span></span><span><span>材料产业</span></span><span><span>及未来</span></span><span>材料</span><span><span>产业</span></span>就业发展。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/254be24d307359f28a85.jpg\" title=\"\"/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院每年为国家培养</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1300</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>余名材料类英才，服务国家“双碳”目标，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>80%</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>以上毕业生到建材<span>建工</span><span>、</span><span>汽车</span><span>、</span><span>交通</span><span>相关</span>行业转型升级与战略性新材料产业发展。近三年，研究生就业率约为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>97.36%</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，本科生就业率约为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>91.74%</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，学生进入建材、建工、化工、汽车、交通、新材料、新能源、电子、信息、生物工程等行业就业创业，三大行业就业比例保持高位。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年学院具体招生专业名称及方向如下：</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/f380c0f3388a4c53b187.png\" title=\"\"/><br/></p><p><strong><span>二、具体安排</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span>申报时间<span><span><span>：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>开营时间：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span>.</span>活动安排</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/9ad86c21ebc9bf433a8a.png\" title=\"\"/></strong></p><p><strong>注：本日程为拟定计划，具体安排后期可能会根据实际情况进行适当调整；营员报到后要求全程参加所有活动。</strong></p><p><strong><span>4.</span>入营名单公示：</strong>我院将于学院官网公示入营名单。</p><p><span><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党领导</span></span><span><span>，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span>诚实守信，身心健康，学风端正，无学业学术行为不端记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.预计</span></span></span><span><span>能够取得本科所在学校推荐免试研究生资格，拟申请到我校攻读研究生（含直博生）的</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩和综合素质优秀：</span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>主修专业必修课程平均学分绩点在</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>及</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>以上</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span>必修课程平均成绩为主修专业前</span></span><span><span><span>30%</span></span></span><span><span>或综合测评成绩为主修专业前</span></span><span><span><span>30%</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>且</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>无不及格课程</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>英语水平要求：</span></span><span><span><span>CET-4</span></span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span></span><span><span>成绩≥</span></span><span><span><span>425</span></span></span><span><span>分，或</span></span><span><span><span>IELTS≥6.0</span></span></span><span><span>，或新</span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL≥90</span></span></span><span><span>分；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span>对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚兴趣</span></span><span><span>，具</span></span><span><span>有较强的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span>在本科阶段具有突出科研成果或专业特长者，予以优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、申请程序</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span>网上报名</strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>本届夏令营活动采取网上报名的方式。凡欲申请本次夏令营活动的各高校优秀学子，请于规定时间内在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325wOyJ4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）报名并上传“申请资料”附件。未于规定时间内在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”报名者，不予受理。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>2.</span>申请资料</strong></p><p>（<span>1</span>）本科成绩单和成绩排名证明（须加盖学校教务部门或院系公章，<span>JPG</span>或<span>PDF</span>格式）；</p><p>（<span>2</span>）有效居民身份证、学生证、学籍验证报告（从学信网<span>www.chsi.com.cn</span>上在线验证并下载）；</p><p>（<span>3</span>）个人陈述（<span>800</span>字左右，无格式要求）；</p><p>（<span>4</span>）个人简历（<span>A4</span>一面，无格式要求）；</p><p>（<span>5</span>）外语水平证明；</p><p>（<span>6</span>）其他体现自身学术水平的代表性论文、获奖或其他原创性工作成果（如有）：</p><p>①\n以第一作者（或教师第一、学生第二）发表的高水平学术期刊论文（<span>SCI</span>、<span>EI</span>收录或北大中文核心期刊）的论文全文以及<span>JCR</span>期刊分区证明；</p><p>②\n在国家、省部级学术科技竞赛、创新发明竞赛中荣获省部级三等奖及以上奖励证书；获授权发明专利，且排序在前<span>3</span>名的证书；</p><p>（<span>7</span>）本科期间获得校级及以上荣誉奖励证书或资格证书；</p><p>（<span>8</span>）诚信承诺书（见附件）。</p><p><strong>以上各项材料如有多页，请合并成一个<span>PDF</span>文件，扫描件要求清晰、工整；文件命名格式：姓名—本科院校名称。</strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span>注：以上材料原件将在入营时审核；对弄虚作假、提供不实信息的申请者，不论何时，一经发现查实，将取消其申请资格。</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>五、其他说明</span></strong></p><p><a href=\"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/t20260618_1403842.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>夏令营期间，我院为营员提供免费餐食并购买人身意外保险。最终被我院拟录取的异地</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非武汉市</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>高校学生（以</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>-10</span></span></span><span><span>月份全国研究生推免系统录取结果</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生录取结果</span></span><span><span>为准），报销往返交通费（机票限经济舱</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>高铁或动车限二等座</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>火车限硬卧和硬座）及住宿费（请务必留好</span></span><span><span>相关</span></span><span><span>报销凭证</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>未尽事宜，欢迎致电</span></span><span><span><span><span>027-87164677</span></span></span></span><span><span>咨询。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学材料科学与工学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>附件：</span><a href=\"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/P020260618730410113239.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"诚信承诺书.pdf\"><span>诚信承诺书.pdf</span></a></p><p><span><span></span></span><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"4b6b532fbf5d682ddc6678da94b28554ba9f387b2cbe1ffd77a8293452061b0b","textLength":4763,"sourceSha256":"96bc725a5fcd14a28cdd56365a5dcd3040b0086d3ffc7554d22864b4e6647055","selector":"article-like:list_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c965fd8487fb3834a905","title":"2026年武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:45.745684+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879282017.png","file":"assets/articles/media/cd5c22adff84eda8d4e6.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260619595116008769.png","file":"assets/articles/media/82dd941246c73b46971d.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879304547.png","file":"assets/articles/media/4ab51c5962f0b922f080.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260619595116103654.png","file":"assets/articles/media/ff39168e2fed34caebf6.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879334354.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/6be7c81e0ed800e51bd6.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618625628695465.png","file":"assets/articles/media/d166bb5334b0acbfb231.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879343398.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/60369d274c88ff242f15.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879353587.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/a18618046bc69cdbb577.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618610879353232.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/254be24d307359f28a85.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618721762363784.png","file":"assets/articles/media/f380c0f3388a4c53b187.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202606/W020260618721762374425.png","file":"assets/articles/media/9ad86c21ebc9bf433a8a.png"}]}
